<% provide :title, 'Build a deck, learn the card game' %>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__copy">
    <h1>Build a deck. Play the Pokémon card game.</h1>
    <p class="hero__lede">
      Browse real card data from the Mega Evolution series, build a 60 card Standard deck that follows
      the official rules, then play it: against the computer, with a friend on one screen, or online with a friend on their own device.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <%= link_to 'Play a game', new_game_path, class: 'btn btn-primary btn-lg' %>
      <%= link_to 'Browse the cards', cards_path, class: 'btn btn-outline-dark btn-lg' %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <% if @featured.size == 3 %>
    <div class="card-fan" aria-label="Three cards from the library">
      <% @featured.each do |card| %>
        <div class="card-fan__item">
          <%= render 'shared/card', card: card, link: card_path(card), tilt: true %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  <% else %>
    <div class="empty-state">
      <h2>No cards yet</h2>
      <p>The card library is empty. Run <code>rails db:seed</code> to load the card data.</p>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</section>

<%= render 'shared/simulation_notice' %>

<ol class="steps">
  <li>
    <h2>Browse the cards</h2>
    <p>Search by name, type or set. Every card shows its HP, attacks, Weakness and Retreat Cost.</p>
    <%= link_to 'Open the library', cards_path %>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2>Build a legal deck</h2>
    <p>Exactly 60 cards, at most 4 copies of a card, at least 1 Basic Pokémon. The builder checks as you go.</p>
    <%= link_to 'Start a deck', new_deck_path %>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2>Play a game</h2>
    <p>Pick a sample deck or your own. Set up, attach Energy, evolve, retreat and take your Prize cards.</p>
    <%= link_to 'Start a game', new_game_path %>
  </li>
</ol>

<aside class="guide-teaser">
  <div>
    <h2>New to the card game?</h2>
    <p>The guide covers setup, what you can do in a turn and how a game is won.</p>
  </div>
  <%= link_to 'Read the guide', about_path, class: 'btn btn-outline-light' %>
</aside>
